        "ProfileStore.cs:26-64; README.md:22-26 — state is split between profiles.json metadata and Profiles/<name>/<folder> contents."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Safety and transaction boundaries",
      "items": [
        "ProfileStore.cs:26-64, 358-570; FolderTreeService.cs:5-240, 321-455 — JSON/path safety and temporary-copy/quarantine recovery are explicit.",
        "ProfileManager.cs:143-240; ProfileFolderSetSwitchService.cs:123-172 — profile changes roll back their transaction, while switch failure can remain partial."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Architecture findings",
      "items": [
        "MainForm.cs; MainViewModel.cs; FolderProfileEditorWindow.cs — UI/VM coupling is bidirectional, and UI/VM contain direct filesystem and dialog concerns.",
        "ProfileStore.cs and FolderTreeService.cs — persistence/security and traversal/copy/recovery responsibilities are concentrated in large classes."
      ]
    }
